# Design Tokens

Tudo em `globals.css`. Usar classes semânticas; não hardcode hex.

<example>
✅ primary → bg-primary, text-primary-foreground
✅ destructive → bg-destructive, text-on-destructive
✅ accent-brand → bg-accent-brand, text-on-accent-brand, hover:bg-accent-brand-hover
❌ bg-[#2563eb], px-[13px]
</example>

**Cores (Tailwind):** primary, primary-foreground, secondary, muted, muted-foreground, accent, accent-brand, on-accent-brand, accent-brand-hover, accent-brand-light, accent-success, destructive, on-destructive, foreground, background, card, border, input, ring, sidebar, sidebar-foreground, sidebar-border.

**Tipografia:** text-page-title, text-page-subtitle, text-section-header, text-section-header-large, text-card-title, text-card-description, text-form-label, text-small, text-small-medium, text-small-semibold, text-caption-leading, text-kpi, text-score, text-hero, text-badge, text-cta-title. Font: Inter (font-sans).

**Spacing:** page-padding, section-gap, column-gap, card-header-padding, card-content-padding, table-cell-padding, tip-banner-padding, footer-padding. Escala: gap-1–12, p-1–12.

**Layout:** w-form, w-content, max-w-content, w-sidebar, w-column, w-action; max-w-hero-title, max-w-login-form, max-w-preview-title, max-w-section-header, max-w-faq, max-w-cta, max-w-footer-brand.

**Radius:** rounded-md, rounded-lg, rounded-xl, card-base. Sem sombras: border border-border bg-card.
